{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日久々のレッスンだたよヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして久々のコンクリートジャンル(東京)は暖かいね〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして久々の乃木坂メンバーはみんなかわいかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/01/04/0789383/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこまはすっかりマンガオタクになってました。\nアイドルの面影が無かったです。鏡を見てびっくりしました。\n少しイメージトレーニングをしてリハビリせねばと思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日はみさみさのお誕生日だよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさみさおめでとうございますヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/01/04/0789383/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/01/04/0789383/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/01/04/0789383/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/01/04/0789383/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/01/04/0789383/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/01/04/0789383/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/01/04/0789383/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/01/04/0789383/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/01/04/0789383/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/01/04/0789383/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/01/04/0789383/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/01/04/0789383/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさみさはいつもいこまちゃんをいいこいいこしてくれる♪\nみさみさは乃木坂のお姉さんとしてしっかり意見を述べたり、夢のために一生懸命な姿勢が凄くかっこいい\n二十歳になったね〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ\n大人だね〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きれいで、可愛くて、何事にも一生懸命な大人の女性になってね!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あといこまちゃんこれからもおしりさわるからね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/01/04/0789383/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では明日ヽ(・∀・)ノ\n全握ですね〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ\nれなりんとペアよっ!!\nれなりなコンビよっ!!\nショートカットコンビよっ!!ヽ(・∀・)ノ\nうほーい!!\nれなりんふぁむの方よろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では寝ます!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ!!"}],"source":"archive"}